## 6. Data Model

### 6.1 Conventions & constants

- Units: metres. Angles in degrees at API boundary, converted inside.
- Axes: right-handed ENU. X = East, Y = North, Z = Up. Ground plane z = 0.
- Azimuth: degrees clockwise from North (0–360). Elevation: degrees above horizon.
- Time: local minutes since midnight (0–1439) + user tz offset (hours east of UTC). No DST handling.
