## 9. Event & State Flow

Handlers live in `ui.App`. State in `AppState`.

**§9.1 Slider drag.** `on_time_change(value)` → `state.minutes = int(value)` → `_request_redraw()` sets `_dirty`, schedules `after(10, _redraw_dynamic)` (coalescing). `_redraw_dynamic`: (1) `solar_position` → `state.sun`; (2) per visible pane `SceneRenderer.draw_dynamic`: delete tags `shadow`/`overlay`, per building call `shadow_polygon` (hull + clip), project, draw (outline-only if heat visible); (3) `draw_compass` + night bg/banner toggle; (4) `_update_time_widgets`; (5) `_update_status`. No heatmap compute; time changes do NOT mark heat stale.

**§9.2 Add building.** `on_add_building` → `_read_building_form` (validate label ≤12, integers, multiples of cell size; invalid → red highlight + status, return). If count = MAX: status msg, return. Build candidate; if `can_place` false, try `find_free_spot` (outward spiral). `add_building` → `touch()` → `revision++`. `_mark_stale` (heat with different `scenario_revision` → legend "STALE", cells dimmed). `selected_id = b.id`. `draw_static`, `_request_redraw`, status "Added B4 at (x,y)".

**§9.3 Run heatmap.** `on_run_heatmap`: if job running, `job.cancel()` + restore button, return. `_collect_heat_params` reads date/location/step. `sunrise_sunset` → t0,t1; if no daylight → "No daylight on this date", return. `HeatmapJob(scenario,date,t0,t1,step)` for active scenario (compare mode: A then B sequentially). Button "Cancel", progress reset. `_heat_tick` loop: `job.step()` one time sample; progressbar from `job.progress()`; if not done → `after(1,_heat_tick)`. On done: `grid = job.result()` → `state.heat[key]`; if compare, `heatmap.compare`, fill summary. `draw_heat` recolours `heat` via `hours_to_color` (or `diff_to_color`). `draw_legend`. Button restored, stale cleared, status "Heatmap done in x.x s".

**§9.4 Toggle compare.** `on_toggle_compare`.
- **On:** if `scenarios["B"]` None → clone A named "B". Show `canvas_B` + title via `grid()`, enable radiobuttons + Copy. `_layout_canvases` refits both views; full redraw both. Active = A. If both heatmaps fresh, `compare` fills summary; else "Run heatmap to compare".
- **Off:** `grid_remove()` B; active = A; diff reset to "Absolute"; B retained; A refit + redraw.
- Status "Comparison on/off". Time/date shared; both panes same sun.

**§9.5 Drag building.** `on_canvas_press`: hit-test via `renderer.hit_test_building`, set `selected_id`, store g0,p0. `on_canvas_drag`: snapped new position, `can_place` (ignoring dragged), `move_building` or red outline + keep last valid. Each valid move: `touch()`, `_mark_stale()`, `_request_redraw()` — shadow updates continuously. `on_canvas_release`: end drag, clear `state.drag`.

